  "stateNote": "In a large mixing bowl, combine the chilled butter, 3 cups of the flour, and the sugar. With your fingertips, rub until the mixture resembles flakes of coarse meal. Beat in the egg and continue to mix until the pastry is smooth. Shape it into a ball, wrap it in wax paper, and refrigerate 1 hour, or until the dough is firm."
